{"availability":"available","full":"Abdulla1x/Trackaholic","name":"Trackaholic","description":"A full-stack, multi-user nutrition tracking app: a React + TypeScript PWA backed by a FastAPI + SQLAlchemy REST API on PostgreSQL, with AI meal analysis that shows its uncertainty.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2024-07-16T11:02:43Z","updated":"2026-10-09T12:39:46Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://macros-calculator-mu.vercel.app","topics":["calorie-tracker","fastapi","fitness-tracker","gemini-api","macro-tracker","nutrition-tracker","postgresql","pwa","python","react","typescript"],"demo":"https://macros-calculator-mu.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T22:04:53.511Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T22:04:53.511Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T22:04:53.511Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:22:59.948Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:13:35.781Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T22:04:53.511Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Formerly Macros Calculator; renamed in October 2026. The live address moves to trackaholic.app later.","🔗 Live app: macros-calculator-mu.vercel.app — sign up and start logging. (Free-tier hosting: the first request after idle can take 30–60 s.)","A full-stack, multi-user nutrition tracking app: a React + TypeScript dashboard UI (installable as a PWA) backed by a FastAPI + SQLAlchemy REST API on PostgreSQL."],"features":["Email + password auth: Argon2id password hashing, JWT bearer tokens (7-day expiry), per-IP rate limiting on login, signup and password reset","Per-user everything: meals, food library, saved meal templates, weight entries, water logs, step counts, supplements and their check-offs, calorie plans, goals/settings, and AI analyses are isolated per account —…","Layered AI quotas: 12 analyses + 16 voice notes + 3 review summaries per user per day, under a global ceiling of 40 calls/day across every account — sized for Gemini's free tier of 20 requests a day per model, and…","What the AI sees: your photos, voice note and description are sent to Google Gemini to estimate the meal, and the app says so beside the Analyze button. Photos are shrunk on your phone first, which also strips their…","What you search for is not logged: the food searches send what you type as a URL parameter, and both the server's access log and its outgoing-request log blank that value before writing the line. The app's own log lines…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Abdulla1x/Trackaholic/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"64a707d0849fdd89c21b683dacfa6b639769b69a201d15ba24ac38573790b1a1","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T21:26:13.995Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T21:26:13.995Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Formerly Macros Calculator; renamed in October 2026. The live address moves to trackaholic.app later.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Abdulla1x/Trackaholic/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Email + password auth: Argon2id password hashing, JWT bearer tokens (7-day expiry), per-IP rate limiting on login, signup and password reset","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Abdulla1x/Trackaholic/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Until one is wired up a forgotten password means a lost account, and the signup page says so rather than letting you find out later.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Abdulla1x/Trackaholic/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Roughly 13 of them are Brevo-specific (they pin the api-key header and the 201 status) and would need rewriting for a different provider; the other 25 test the endpoints and would not.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Abdulla1x/Trackaholic/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"64a707d0849fdd89c21b683dacfa6b639769b69a201d15ba24ac38573790b1a1","sourceUrl